:"Rituals of celebration","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Correspondences for Samhain.","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}}],"description":{"type":"/type/text","value":"\"Llewellyn's Sabbat Essentials series explores the old and new ways of celebrating the seasonal rites that are the cornerstones in the witch's year. A well-rounded introduction to Samhain, this attractive book features rituals, recipes, lore, and correspondences. It includes hands-on information for modern celebrations, spells and divination, recipes and crafts, invocations and prayers, and more! Samhain--also known as Halloween--is the final spoke in the wheel of the year. At this time, the harvest has finished and the veil between the worlds is at its thinnest. This guide shows you how to practice the serious work of divination and honoring the dead along with the more light-hearted activities of Halloween\"--Publisher's description."},"series":["Llewellyn's sabbat essentials","Llewellyn's sabbat essentials"],"local_id":["urn:sfpl:31223134169490","urn:sfpl:31223134169482"],"full_title":"Samhain rituals, recipes, & lore for Halloween","lc_classifications":["BF1572.S35 R35 2015","BF1572.S35R35 2015"],"key":"/books/OL26977624M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL7505903A","name":"Diana Rajchel"}],"subtitle":"rituals, recipes, & lore for Halloween","subjects":["Samhain"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"pagination":"252 pages","source_records":["marc:marc_openlibraries_sanfranciscopubliclibrary/sfpl_chq_2018_12_24_run06.mrc:209726744:2824","bwb:9780738742168","marc:marc_loc_2016/BooksAll.2016.part42.utf8:42985041:1036"],"title":"Samhain","lccn":["2015005468"],"notes":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Includes bibliographical references (pages 229-237) and index."},"number_of_pages":252,"isbn_13":["9780738742168"],"edition_name":"First edition.","dewey_decimal_class":["299/.94"],"isbn_10":["0738742163"],"publish_date":"2015","publish_country":"mnu","